  "description": "CreatePdf.NET is a simple, fast PDF creation library for .NET applications. Generate PDF documents with text rendering, bitmap graphics, and optional OCR text extraction. Lightweight, dependency-free, 100% test coverage. Perfect for creating reports, invoices, receipts, labels, and documents. Supports .NET 10, .NET 9, and .NET 8 with fluent C# API.",
